PHASE 5 — INTELLIGENT RECONCILIATION ENGINE
==================================================

This is the central feature of SettleWise AI.

Build a reconciliation engine using deterministic financial matching rules.

Matching signals:
- Exact invoice reference
- Exact transaction amount
- Customer identity
- Transaction date
- Description similarity
- Partial payment relationships

Create a weighted matching score.

Example configurable scoring:
- Invoice reference match: 35 points
- Amount match: 30 points
- Customer match: 15 points
- Date proximity: 10 points
- Description similarity: 10 points

Classify results:
- 90–100: High confidence
- 70–89: Review recommended
- Below 70: Manual investigation

These scores are recommendations, not proof of payment identity.

Handle:
- Exact matches
- Partial payments
- Unmatched payments
- Duplicate candidates
- Multiple possible invoice matches
- Overpayments
- Underpayments

Build:
- Run Reconciliation button
- Reconciliation progress indicator
- Matched records
- Unmatched records
- Manual matching interface
- Approve match action
- Reject match action
- Reconciliation history

Never silently mark uncertain records as reconciled.

All financial calculations must use decimal arithmetic.

